==Strategy==
Easy stage, just use 3-4 meatshields to protect your base from Snowballs, Ws and Wafer Cat BIGs. Use other ranged attackers to kill the Icy Doges. When the Icy Doges die, rush the base with fast units like Manic Lion or Bullet Train. Alternatively, you could immediately send Bullet Train Cat at the start of the level to avoid fighting all the enemies.

